{"c":{"323821":["Mahiru Kouzuki","Female","b323821-iJcXLuaa4uoa.png","Mahiru is a typical high school girl who follows the philosophy of \"nothing matters.\" Despite being sensitive, she often gets upset over small things, although she truly cares about others. When she was young, Mahiru used to draw illustrations under the pseudonym \"Kurage Yoru.",253],"323822":["Kano Yamanouchi","Female","b323822-b9pmjVcWjemp.png","Meet Kano, a former idol who is determined to achieve her dreams! She's a strong-willed individual who knows what she wants and isn't easily swayed by others. Kano used to be part of the \"Sunflower Dolls\" idol group, where she performed as \"Nonoka Tachibana.",392],"323823":["Kiui Watase",null,"b323823-YVsvmI48ta2x.png","Kiui and Mahiru have been friends since childhood. Operating under the persona of the Vtuber \"Nox Ryugasaki,\" Kiui consistently promotes their belief in being the strongest individual.",421],"323824":["Mei Takanashi","Female","b323824-Sbw1HiIuYegf.png","Mei attends a high school affiliated with the conservatory. She started her musical education at a young age and has earned numerous awards in competitions, demonstrating her exceptional talent.",180],"326377":["Miiko","Female","b326377-ycK77vBFLahU.png","An idol who claims to be forever 17 and the strongest in the galaxy. She has been active for a long time and is always full of motivation and perseverance.",43],"326378":["Melo Setou","Female","b326378-zt5XZqDRQXEj.png","",17],"326379":["Momoko Yanagi","Female","b326379-1SIgLmkBUUmf.png","",2],"326380":["Akari Suzumura","Female","b326380-lM3pdbwHj0t7.png","",2],"332266":["Kaho Kouzuki","Female","b332266-AwBLyDoEZY4K.png","",7],"332267":["Mion Hayakawa","Female","b332267-OVR5iBCeZltG.png","",6],"332268":["Ariel","Female","b332268-RIPBMu4xa8om.png","",12],"332269":["Koharu","Female","b332269-W4hvnoX6liP1.png","",20],"332270":["Yukine Hayakawa","Female","b332270-vn9oswAZmcez.png","",1],"332271":["Honami","Female","b332271-tcCDeOSNSm8s